# Luxury Glamping Resort in Kumbhalgarh, Rajasthan

Kumbhalgarh is a popular destination in Rajasthan, known for its historic fort, scenic Aravalli Hills and natural surroundings. Travellers visiting this region can explore unique accommodation experiences, including luxury glamping stays.

## Discover Collective Hotels Bodhi

Collective Hotels Bodhi offers a nature-inspired luxury glamping experience in Kumbhalgarh. The property features distinctive dome accommodations, mountain views and thoughtfully designed spaces for a relaxing stay.

Guests can explore different accommodation experiences, including planet-inspired domes and the Signature Water Villa.

